# First Horde wolf from Ogunaro Wolfrunner (the Valley of Honor).
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70338 tables via wago.tools (ItemSparse: level,
# price, races, riding spell; SkillLineAbility: Riding); npcs.json and
# items.json for the trainer, the vendor and its stock.
# Forever riding: one Riding skill (Apprentice 75 from level 40, Journeyman 150
# at 60). Training costs 100g and 1,000g (Forever's world data: the trainers of
# Velma Warnam and Genn Fairweather, build 70124) and comes with a mount
# (Blizzard). ItemSparse lists the mounts at 20g (level 40) and 200g (level 60)
# for every race of the faction, but each one also needs Wolf Riding (825;
# MountCapability), which SkillLineAbility gives only Orcs with Riding: the
# faction's other races and the Skyborne must learn it.
# ASSUMED: Kildar teaches it to them at Exalted with Orgrimmar (Classic
# rule; a beta player guide says other races' mounts need Exalted). In-game
# check: a Tauren at Kildar, with and without Exalted.
# ASSUMED: Honored with your race's home city takes 10% off training and mounts
# (beta player guides; Classic had the same). In-game check: the price at Honored.

step Learn to ride
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Kildar and Ogunaro Wolfrunner's kennel are in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor. At 40 Kildar teaches Riding to Orcs for 100g (10% less at Honored with Orgrimmar), and it comes with a wolf. Other races learn Riding, with their own first mount, at their own race's riding trainer.
  level 40
  train 4752 only Orc                 -- Kildar, riding trainer
  skill Riding 75

step Wolf Riding for other races
  only Tauren,Troll,Undead,Skyborne
  when !knows 825
  tip Any Horde race can buy these wolves, but riding one also takes Wolf Riding, which only Orcs get with Riding. Kildar teaches it to other races once they are Exalted with Orgrimmar (the Orgrimmar Reputation guide shows the way). Until then, don't buy a wolf for this character.
  rep "Orgrimmar" Exalted
  train 4752                          -- Kildar, Wolf Riding

step Pick a colour
  tip Ogunaro Wolfrunner sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like.
  vendor 3362                         -- Ogunaro Wolfrunner
  buy 1132 npc 3362 optional          -- Horn of the Timber Wolf, 20g
  buy 5665 npc 3362 optional          -- Horn of the Dire Wolf, 20g
  buy 5668 npc 3362 optional          -- Horn of the Brown Wolf, 20g
  note Horn of the Black Wolf is in the client (20g) but our data has no vendor selling it.
